NOTE ON BUNDLED / DOWNLOADED MODELS
This MIT license covers ONLY the ImageWorld source code in this repository.
The AI models downloaded at runtime are governed by their own licenses, e.g.:
  - SAM 2 / SAM 3 (Meta)        : Meta's SAM license (SAM 3 is gated; commercial
                                  use is restricted — review before any SaaS use)
  - TripoSR (Stability AI)      : Apache-2.0 / MIT (per model card)
  - AudioLDM (CVSSP)            : check the model card on Hugging Face
  - SHARP (Apple)               : Apple ML Research license
Review each model's license before commercial deployment.
